        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_s7_outputs_body" value="• 00_EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY_AND_TOP_OPPORTUNITIES.md（含 Stage 0 动态涌现剖析与 Top 16 总榜）&#10;• 01_POWER_ENERGY_ONLINE_TESTING_OPPORTUNITIES.md · 02_SEMICONDUCTOR_ONLINE_TESTING_OPPORTUNITIES.md&#10;• 03_ROI_FINANCIAL_MODEL_AND_ELO_RANKING.md（三档回收期敏感性 + Stage 2 淘汰候选完整审计表）&#10;• 04_PRODUCT_TECH_AND_UPGRADE_STRATEGY_PLAYBOOK.md · 05_VERIFIED_EVIDENCE_CITATIONS_INDEX.md&#10;• 06_EVALUATION_SCORECARD_AND_COST_TELEMETRY.json（完整记录 discovered_tracks · funnel · top16 三档指标）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#064E3B;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=13;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
